senses.gloss:
त 3. त, अस्, m. a tail; any tail except that
of the Bos Gaurus; the tail of a jackal; the breast;
the womb; the hip or flank; a warrior; a thief; a
wicked man; an outcast, a barbarian or Mleccha; a
Buddha; a jewel; nectar, the food of the immortals;
(आ, अम्), f. n. passing, crossing; virtue, sanctity;
(आ), f., N. of Lakṣmī.
